            </note>
            <note corresp="#d92-f2" n="2" xml:id="d92-f2-content">
                <p>This telegram from London, not printed, concerned the need anticipated by
                        Spofford for firm financial policy
                    statements available for consideration at regional economic meetings
                    (740.5/5–251).</p>
            </note>
